msgstr "Birt sem `einarolafsson/toxoplasma-plaque-segmentation-cpsam-r5 <https://huggingface.co/einarolafsson/toxoplasma-plaque-segmentation-cpsam-r5>`_, sem ``cpsam_plaque_r5``."

